os are also used for other Pok\u00e9mon League-related variants.","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"45":{"id":45,"name":"Cracked Ice Holo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This variant features a holographic pattern that resembles cracked\/shattered\/broken ice\/glass. It's also known as *Shattered Holo*.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"46":{"id":46,"name":"Non-holo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is a non-holographic variant. If a variant isn't holographic, has no other specific defining characteristics, and isn't part of the standard set (*Normal*\/*Normal Holo*) or the parallel set (e.g., *Reverse Holo*), *Non-holo* is used as the default variant.\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"47":{"id":47,"name":"1999-2000 Copyright","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This variant has *1999-2000* in the copyright text instead of the regular copyright date. It's exclusive to the *Base Set* expansion (also commonly called the *4th print*), the *Thunderstorm Gift Box* theme deck of the *Fossil* expansion, and the Australian red Pok\u00e9mon logo booster packs of the *Fossil* expansion.","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"48":{"id":48,"name":"Cosmos Holo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This variant features a holographic pattern in the artwork that consists of dots and circles of different sizes.","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"49":{"id":49,"name":"No e-Reader","isStandardSetTyp