"damage counters\" Text Error)","isStandardSetType":true,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":false,"hasQualifiers":true,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is an error variant of *Rocket's Minefield Gym (Gym Challenge 119\/132)*. Also see *Normal*.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":1990},"356":{"id":356,"name":"Great Detective Pikachu Stamp, Jumbo Size","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":true,"descriptionMd":"See *Great Detective Pikachu Stamp* and *Jumbo Size*.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"357":{"id":357,"name":"Normal Holo (Non-holo Error)","isStandardSetType":true,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":false,"hasQualifiers":true,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is an error variant of *Dark Dragonite (Team Rocket 5\/82)*. Also see *Normal Holo*.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":2990},"358":{"id":358,"name":"Normal Holo, Jumbo Size","isStandardSetType":true,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":true,"descriptionMd":"See *Normal Holo* and *Jumbo Size*.\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":2001},"361":{"id":361,"name":"Parallel Set (Confetti Holo)","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":true,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":true,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"The standard set (*Normal* or *Normal Holo* variant) often has a complementary set called the *parallel set*. This parallel set is shown as the second column on official checklists.\r\n\r\n*Parallel Set (Confetti Holo)* is a parallel set variant that features a *Confetti Holo* pattern.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":5000},"362":{"id":362,"name":"Expansion Stamp Holo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":true,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"The standard set (*Normal* or *Normal Holo* variant) often has a complementary set called the *parallel set*. This parallel set is shown as the second column on official checklists.\r\n\r\n*Expansion Stamp Holo* is a parallel set variant that features the holographic logo of the expansion on the artwork.\r\n","preferredOrder":8,"cardVariantSortingOrder":5000},"363":{"id":363,"name":"Normal Holo","isStandardSetType":true,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is the standard set variant featuring a holographic pattern. Standard set variants are shown as the first column on official checklists.\r\n\r\nCards with a *Rare Holo* rarity usually feature holographic artwork. More recent cards with a *Rare* rarity might as well.\r\n\r\nDepending on the expansion series\/era, the following holographic patterns are used:\r\n\r\n- *Scarlet & Violet*: horizontal refraction (mirage)\r\n- *Sword & Shield*: vertical lines\r\n- *Sun & Moon*: water web\/waves\r\n- *Black & White*: horizontal lines (tinsel)\r\n- *HeartGold & SoulSilver*: dots and circles (cosmos)\r\n- *Diamond & Pearl*: dots and circles (cosmos)\r\n\r\nCards with a higher tier rarity are usually completely holographic.\r\n","preferredOrder":2,"cardVariantSortingOrder":2000},"366":{"id":366,"name":"Confetti Holo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This variant features a holographic pattern in the artwork that resembles confetti.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"367":{"id":367,"name":"Energy Holo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":true,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"The standard set (*Normal* or *Normal Holo* variant) often has a complementary set called the *parallel set*. This parallel set is shown as the second column on official checklists.\r\n\r\n*Energy Holo* is a parallel set variant that features a holographic pattern in the artwork that resembles energy symbols.\r\n","preferredOrder":7,"cardVariantSortingOrder":5000},"368":{"id":368,"name":"Promo","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is a placeholder variant for promotional cards that only have one variant. It's neither part of the standard set (*Normal* or *Normal Holo*) or the parallel set (e.g., *Reverse Holo*). This variant is to be updated to a more specific variant.\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":1000},"369":{"id":369,"name":"Black Star Promo Symbol","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":false,"hasQualifiers":false,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This variant has a Black Star Promo symbol on the bottom left or right of the card instead of its proper expansion symbol.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"370":{"id":370,"name":"Cosmos Holo (Upside Down Back Error)","isStandardSetType":false,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":true,"hasQualifiers":true,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is an error variant of *Mew (POP Series 5 3\/17)* and *Pikachu (POP Series 5 12\/17)*. Also see *Cosmos Holo*.","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":null},"371":{"id":371,"name":"Normal Holo (Red Ink Dot)","isStandardSetType":true,"isParallelSetType":false,"isFirstEditionPrint":false,"isGeneric":false,"hasQualifiers":true,"isCombined":false,"descriptionMd":"This is an error variant of *Blastoise (Base Set 2\/102)*. Also see *Normal Holo*.\r\n","preferredOrder":null,"cardVariantSortingOrder":2990},"372":{"id":372,"name":"Brilliant Stars Stamp, Jumbo Size","isStandardSetT